OL,3,GNEWSAUrgent funding plea for charity's
OL,4,Atherapy services
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that helps people who have
OL,7,Fhad a brain injury has made an urgent
OL,8,Fcall for funding.
OL,10,FHeadway North Staffordshire in Cobridge
OL,11,Fhas been running since 1985, but now
OL,12,Fits speech therapy and counselling
OL,13,Fservices are under threat due to a lack
OL,14,Fof funds.
OL,16,FGraham Maddox, who was supported by the
OL,17,Fcharity, now leads woodworking classes.
OL,19,FHe could only say the word "help" when
OL,20,Fhe started therapy with the charity. "I
OL,21,Fimproved such a lot that I can hold
OL,22,Fdown a conversation," he said.
